{"id":"vod_bf_15205","vodId":"15205","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"间谍过家家第二季","name_cn":"间谍过家家第二季","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/ee4e47fc0366d8cd13d66a54ab5bc8ed.jpg"},"summary":"人人都有不愿对他人露出的一面。　　这是一个情报战的年代，全球各国都全力参与其中，表面上却不动声色。　　东国和西国已陷入冷战长达十多年。“黄昏”是一名顶尖间谍，隶属西国专门对付东国的情报局 WISE。他奉命执行一项秘密任务：追踪东国国家统一党党魁唐纳文‧戴斯蒙德的一举一动。这名危险人物为东西两国间的和平构成重重威胁。　　这场行动代号是“枭”。黄昏必须在一个星期内组织家庭，潜入戴斯蒙德儿子就读的名校，参加他们的日常社交聚会。他假扮成精神科医生洛伊德‧佛杰，迅速组成家庭，一切照计划进行，不料他的“女儿”安妮亚竟有读心术，“妻子”约儿更是个杀手！　　志同道合、互相隐瞒真实身份的三人就这么住在一块。　　维持世界和平的重责大任落在这个临时家庭的手上。事情的发展，无可预期！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:50:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiadierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/jiandieguojiajiad